cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
authors:
  - name: RakTikoo
title: "handoff-reconciler: verify an AI session handoff against git before you trust it"
version: 0.2
date-released: 2026-11-14
license: MIT
url: "https://github.com/RakTikoo/handoff-reconciler"
repository-code: "https://github.com/RakTikoo/handoff-reconciler"
abstract: >-
  Freezes a structured, machine-checkable handoff at the end of an AI coding
  session, then verifies every claim in it against git and test ground truth
  at the start of the next session and prints a traffic-light drift report.
  Deterministic; no LLM inside the tool.
keywords:
  - handoff
  - AI agents
  - git
  - verification
  - session
